      "id": "cma-159133-0",
      "field": "inscriptions[0].inscription_translation",
      "text": "I made this bright mirror \nBy refining the three metals.\nBoYa is making music; \nThe multitude of gods display their forms.\n[The mirror] is suitable \nfor a man with great wealth and good fortune.\nHe [who has it] will add years to life.\nHis descendants will also prosper.\nEven this master will enjoy longevity.",
      "source_text": "吾作明鏡，幽凍三商。伯牙作樂，\n眾神風容。宜大富兮，有福安服。\n曾年益壽，子孫番昌，其師命長。",
      "remark": ""
    }
  ],
